  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Klimapuljen 2014 - Support to negotiation activitites</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main focus has been on two activities: 1) promote greenhouse gas emissions reductions by providing readily-usable information about mitigation opportunities and policies within energy efficiency, and 2) support the UNSGs Climate Summit in New York in September 2014 developing an innovative and scalable new instrument for financing energy efficiency in developing countries.</narrative>
